iable, Pretendard, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#9ca3af;&quot;&gt;출력&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#4b5563;margin-top:3px;&quot;&gt;artifacts/day06/&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#111827;padding-left:12px;line-height:17px;&quot;&gt;rf_action_baseline.joblib&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#111827;padding-left:12px;line-height:17px;&quot;&gt;rf_feature_columns.json&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#111827;padding-left:12px;line-height:17px;&quot;&gt;rf_training_info.json&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dde3;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="884" y="744" width="328" height="216" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;font-family:Pretendard Variable, Pretendard, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;background:#dcf3e5;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;&quot;&gt;6일차&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;&quot;&gt;36_evaluate_validation.py&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px;font-family:Pretendard Variable, Pretendard, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#4b5563;word-break:keep-all;&quot;&gt;학습된 모델로 val 시퀀스(S02)를 예측해 Accuracy · Macro F1 · 혼동행렬 계산. 설정을 고를 때는 여기까지만 봄&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;font-family:Pretendard Variable, Pretendard, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#9ca3af;&quot;&gt;출력&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#4b5563;margin-top:3px;&quot;&gt;reports/day06/metrics/&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#111827;padding-left:12px;line-height:17px;&quot;&gt;validation_metrics.txt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#111827;padding-left:12px;line-height:17px;&quot;&gt;validation_predictions.csv&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#4b5563;margin-top:3px;&quot;&gt;reports/day06/confusion/&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#111827;padding-left:12px;line-height:17px;&quot;&gt;validation_confusion_matrix.png&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dde3;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1292" y="220" width="328" height="256" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;font-family:Pretendard Variable, Pretendard, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;background:#dcf3e5;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;&quot;&gt;6일차 · 마지막 1회&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;&quot;&gt;40_evaluate_test.py&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px;font-family:Pretendard Variable, Pretendard, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#4b5563;word-break:keep-all;&quot;&gt;모델을 확정한 뒤 처음 보는 사람(test, S03)으로 최종 성능을 한 번만 확인&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;font-family:Pretendard Variable, Pretendard, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#9ca3af;&quot;&gt;출력&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Consolas, D2Coding, monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#4b5